# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source captures still held locally (see docs/DATA_ACCESS.md)
#
# The raw bible.com chapter captures and the per-version normalized verse
# records remain LOCAL ONLY. The two aligned corpus files
# (data/aligned/thadou_kuki_niv_{parallel,ml}.jsonl) are deliberately
# PUBLISHED — see LICENSE_NOTES.md and docs/DATA_ACCESS.md: no redistribution
# permission is established for THADBSI (Bible Society of India) or NIV
# (Biblica), and the text was published at the repository owner's explicit
# direction. No license is claimed for it.
#
# The three split files are also still local-only: they are reproducible from
# the published corpus plus data/aligned/splits/split_manifest.json.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
data/normalized/
data/aligned/splits/*.jsonl

# Rejected/scrapped corpus drops and local build scratch
local_only/
*.local.jsonl

# Console captures from collection runs (logs/*.log are the record of truth)
logs/*.out
